<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Physics dropped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Physics dropped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it dropped coverage of General Physics Corp after news that it will be acquired by National Patent Development Corp.</p>
<p>-- Goldman said it does not follow National Patent.</p>
<p>-- General Physics was unchanged at 4-3/8, while National Patent gained 1/16 to 9-5/16.</p>
</text>
